  "content": "<pre><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">真·三国无双中的关羽梗<br><br>此模组不提供新武器或物品，仅为史诗战斗添加了一种新的武器类型。</span><br></span><br></span></pre><pre><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">因此，您需要搭配<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spartan-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">斯巴达武器（长柄刀）</a></span>、<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士（洛哈伯斧）</a></span>或<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f00\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeons-gear\" rel=\"nofollow\">地下城装备（长柄刀）</a></span>游玩</span></span><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">——我已为其制作了兼容性支持。<br>或者</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fepicfight-docs.readthedocs.io%252fen%252flatest%252fGuides%252fpage2%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><strong>制作数据包</strong></span></span></span></a></span><span style=\"color:#f00\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:'times new roman', times, serif\"><span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">自行将某种武器类型定义为弯刀。<br></span></span></span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#f90\">强烈建议配合<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a style=\"color:#f90\" href=\"https://beta.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/epic-fight-animations/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗战斗动画资源包</a></span>游玩。</span></pre><pre><span><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\"><br>数据包示例：</span><br><br><span style=\"font-family:'times new roman', times, serif;font-size:14px\">{{ \"attributes\": { \"common\": { \"armor_negation\":7.0, \"impact\":1.5, \"max_strikes\":2 } }, \"type\":\"falchion\"}<br><br></span></span></pre><pre><span style=\"font-size:18px\">该动作集包含三种普通攻击和三种特殊技能。<br>三种不同的特殊技能取决于您输入的<strong>方向</strong>键。<br><strong>无畏（被动）：</strong>第三次普通攻击不会被敌人的攻击打断。<br><strong>前进 + 特殊技能：</strong>向前快速进行两次上挑斩击，能有效击退敌人。<br><strong>左/右 + 特殊技能：</strong>快速斜斩，不会被敌人攻击打断。<br><strong>后退 + 特殊技能：</strong>大范围横扫后，对敌人进行斩击将其击倒。可在空中施放剑气对倒地敌人追加攻击。<br></span></pre><pre><span>&nbsp;<br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/h2cNB7Z/falchion-normal-attack.gif\" alt=\"弯刀-普通攻击\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/PNvgmdV/Falchion-Forward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"><br></span></pre><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/g9y38DL/Falchion-Backward-Attack.gif\" alt=\"弯刀-后退攻击\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/L92vCBv/Falchion-Side-Attack.gif\" alt=\"弯刀-侧向攻击\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
